{"seq":1,"slug":"stellar-structure-evolution","title":"恒星结构与演化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-structure-evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hydrostatic-equilibrium","title":"流体静力平衡与恒星结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-structure-evolution/hydrostatic-equilibrium","wordCount":2421,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"nuclear-fusion-processes","title":"核聚变过程：pp链与CNO循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-structure-evolution/nuclear-fusion-processes","wordCount":2563,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"stellar-evolution-tracks","title":"恒星演化轨迹：赫罗图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-structure-evolution/stellar-evolution-tracks","wordCount":2742,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"恒星结构与演化\">恒星结构与演化</h1><p>本章探讨恒星内部的物理结构及其在漫长时间尺度上的演化规律。恒星是自引力束缚的等离子体球，其稳定性依赖于引力压缩与内部压力（辐射压、气体压、简并压）之间的精密平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心主题\">核心主题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>流体静力平衡</strong> — 恒星结构四大基本方程的推导与物理含义</li>\n<li><strong>核聚变过程</strong> — pp链反应与CNO循环的温度依赖性和能量产率</li>\n<li><strong>演化轨迹</strong> — 不同质量恒星在赫罗图上的演化路径与时间尺度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"关键物理量\">关键物理量</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>物理量</th>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>典型值（太阳）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中心温度</td>\n<td>T_c</td>\n<td>1.57 × 10⁷ K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中心密度</td>\n<td>ρ_c</td>\n<td>1.62 × 10⁵ kg/m³</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光度</td>\n<td>L</td>\n<td>3.828 × 10²⁶ W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心氢燃烧寿命</td>\n<td>τ_MS</td>\n<td>~10¹⁰ yr</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}